{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33994","headline":"奉和鲁望怀杨台文杨鼎文二秀才 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望怀杨台文杨鼎文二秀才","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羊昙留我昔经春，各以篇章鬬五云。\n宾草每容闲处见，击琴多任醉中闻。\n钓前青翰交加倚，醉後红鱼取次分。\n爲说风标曾入梦，上仙初着翠霞帬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33994.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33994","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}